     "<div dir=\"ltr\">FYI!<div><br></div><div>R<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\"gmail_sendername\" dir=\"auto\">Elizabeth Williams</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ewil...@carpentries.org</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Mon, Dec 16, 2019 at 1:45 PM<br>Subject: [davis] Magical Map Making! - Join Us Tomorrow 2-4pm<br>To: local-davis &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">local...@lists.carpentries.org</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><b>&quot;<font face=\"arial black, sans-serif\">Magical Map Making</font>&quot;</b></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><i><b>Come draw/code/color or simply be present for a fun workshop about all things maps. We&#39;ll have materials to make your own treasure map, magical map, or map with invisible ink! No artistic ability or coding experience required, but an appreciation or desire to build appreciation of all things mapped and magical is preferred. All welcome tomorrow 2-4pm at </b></i><i><b>508 2nd Street, Suite 208, Davis.</b></i></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><i><b><br></b></i></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><i>All are welcome! Please feel free to forward this message to other Carpentries related lists; the more the merrier at this awesomely nerdy/geeky version of a holiday party!</i></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><i><br></i></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Best,</div></div><div><div data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\" dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><b>Elizabeth Williams</b></div><div>Director o